#: app/templates/landing/index.html:322
msgid "How is this different from Google Search Console?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:326
msgid ""
"Search Console gives you the data — thousands of rows and no particular "
"order. LinkBayCMS gives you the five things to fix Monday morning, ranked"
" by how much they're worth and how likely they are to recover. It's not "
"another archive; it's a shortlist."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:333
msgid "How do you know a page is really declining, and not just noisy?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:337
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A page only makes the list if it clears a minimum relevance threshold, "
"has dropped at least 30%% and at least 20 clicks/month, held that drop "
"for two consecutive months, and is falling faster than the rest of your "
"site in the same period. That last check alone removes most of the false "
"alarms — it's the difference between \"your page is broken\" and \"Google"
" shipped an update and your whole site moved.\""
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:344
msgid "Do I need to install anything on my site?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:348
msgid ""
"No. LinkBayCMS is not a CMS and doesn't touch your site — it reads your "
"existing Google Search Console data with read-only access. Nothing to "
"embed, no plugin, no code changes."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:355
msgid "Is this built for e-commerce or SaaS marketing sites too?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:359
msgid ""
"Not really — it's built specifically for publishers and editorial sites "
"with 500 to 20,000 indexed pages and at least 20,000 organic clicks a "
"month, where organic search is the main source of revenue. Below that "
"volume, declines are hard to tell apart from noise, and our output gets "
"less reliable. We'd rather tell you that upfront than sign you up and "
"have you churn in month two."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:366
msgid "Is my Search Console data safe?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/landing/index.html:370
msgid ""
"We connect via Google's standard read-only access — we can see your "
"performance data, we can't change anything on your property. We never "
"invent numbers: click figures come straight from Search Console, and any "
"revenue estimate is only shown if you provide it, always labeled as an "
"estimate."
msgstr ""

